            <ArticleTitle>[Late complications of proctocolectomy treated by ileo-anal anastomosis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>984-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors briefly describe the principal late complications of ileo-anal anastomoses: anal fistulae, anal strictures, bowel obstruction, gallstones, renal stones, desmoid tumours. The aetiological hypotheses and the therapeutic possibilities are analysed for each complication.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
